  "priorExpiration": "2024-05-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4001.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to other New Hampshire state, county, and local law enforcement agencies seeking grants from the northern border alliance fund, for the following purposes:\n\n(a) Overtime costs for officers performing law enforcement activities under this program; and\n\n(b) Training costs, including overtime backfill, for all officers participating in this program to attend the mandatory training provided by the New Hampshire state police, as described in Saf-C 4004.01(b).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4000) #13815, INTERIM, eff 12-1-23, EXPIRES: 5-29-24; ss by #14024, eff 7-12-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4000.html"
